# Rows to merge into docs/TESTING.md

Source: the MD-09 fix (2026-11-12), `docs/audits/tech-debt/fix-md09/README.md`.

## Safety Net Map: `MediaStore.ts`: failures (P3)

In the "pinned" cell, replace the sentence "A camera the browser cannot read (`NotReadableError`) turns the camera off with no access issue and no help context, and keeps the microphone requested." with:

> MD-09 (fixed in `01-md09-device-in-use.patch`): a camera the browser cannot read (`NotReadableError` on a camera and microphone request) turns the camera off, keeps the microphone requested, and records `"device_in_use"` for the camera and its help context until the camera is asked for again. A microphone-only request that fails the same way turns the microphone off and keeps `"device_in_use"` through a camera-only run, until the microphone is asked for again.

In the "gaps" cell, replace "a `NotFoundError` or `NotReadableError` on a microphone-only request" with "a `NotFoundError` on a microphone-only request", and add: "the tooltip text that each help context selects in `CameraMenuItem.svelte` and `MicrophoneMenuItem.svelte` (checked by `svelte-check`, not by a test)".

